            "sid": "DAN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwasin neajeeda majeek sea fuga saang'a aba jeeda wiikajeanda; ea aba eawoojiga mwahita wiikajeanda gaygwaduulu lukghumeeda ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda; ak gajeayiin gidamuy deageaw was uhuuda gheeda sibata ASEETA ak gaygoobiida hoowa gwaroonyi siida jea gweadu nyariida, ea muudeanooda ghayi sissa ASEETA niny.”",
          "type": "text",
